# Story: three windows, one framed. Someone goes from window to window by holding ⌃⌥Space, looking, and letting go;
# changes their mind twice; and finds that a tap still does what it always did.
# Reference: T30, A51 (docs/features/F51-peek.md). Window ids start at 101.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
dock 103 beside 101 bottom
zoom 101
cursor 720 450
# A tap: everything, and it stays.
key ctrl+opt+space
expect camera root
wait 1
expect camera root
expect outline none
back
expect camera 101
# A slow press, as of someone who is lost: the outline shows, nothing is chosen, the keys come up within a second.
# Everything stays.
keydown ctrl+opt+space
wait 0.6
expect outline 101
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera root
expect outline none
back
expect camera 101
# Held: everything at once, and after a moment an outline around the view that was left.
keydown ctrl+opt+space
expect camera root
expect outline none
wait 0.4
expect outline 101
# The outline follows the pointer. Letting go frames what is outlined, and gives it the keyboard.
cursor 1200 400
wait 0.1
expect outline 102
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera 102
expect fills 102
expect hidden 101
expect outline none
expect ring 102
# One move in history: back is where the peek began.
back
expect camera 101
# Keyboard only: ⌃⌥ are down anyway, so the arrows walk the outline instead of moving the view.
keydown ctrl+opt+space
wait 0.4
key ctrl+opt+down
expect outline 103
expect camera root
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera 103
back
expect camera 101
# Changing one's mind: ⎋ returns, and does not pause Arbor; so does letting go without choosing.
keydown ctrl+opt+space
wait 0.4
cursor 1210 400
wait 0.1
expect outline 102
key ctrl+opt+escape
expect camera 101
expect outline none
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera 101
keydown ctrl+opt+space
wait 2
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera 101
# Neither left a trace: forward still leads to Mail, which the last `back` came from.
forward
expect camera 103
back
expect camera 101
# A click lands at once, with the keys still down.
keydown ctrl+opt+space
wait 0.4
cursor 1200 420
wait 0.1
mouse down
wait 0.1
mouse up
wait 0.1
expect camera 102
keyup ctrl+opt+space
expect camera 102
